<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκ-εῖον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκ-ήϊον</span></b> , τό, = foreg. <i><span class="en">
			11
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.68
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Art.</u>
			47
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			77
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			And.
			1.40
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Euthd.</u>
			300b
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκίον</span>
			 (q.v.): </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>cauldron, pot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				152
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκίον</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				329a
			</span></i> codd.: esp. <i>copper</i> in baths, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				9.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἐρυθρόν</span>
			<i>vessel</i> of pure copper, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. μολυβοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1648.62
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>concave metal reflector</i> in a lamp, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bronze structure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.22.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χαλκεῖα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), at Athens, <i>a festival at the
				end of the month Pyanopsion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phanod.
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				90
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.105
			</span></i>; title of play by Menander.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
